{"version":1,"content":"<p>今晚（10月31日）萬聖夜，九巴列出通宵巴士資訊， 方便市民於各區參加萬聖節派對後，往返港九新界不同地區。</p><p>九巴將密切留意乘客需求，特別是中環、旺角、尖沙嘴及啟德一帶的客況，適時加強服務。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-01T03:38:13.723051+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":94,"images":0,"source":"明報 消閒","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-31T01:01:25+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-01T03:30:42.064602+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-01T03:30:42.064602+00:00","content_hash":"b065b0cc9d00d62a0f036a1a3803daa70cbffb2c30bef00950a6203b94ef19a2","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}